msgid "Discover how to change the main logo of the website"
msgstr "Otkrijte kako promijeniti glavni logo web stranice"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:10
msgid "Open Header Builder"
msgstr "Otvorite alat za sastavljanje zaglavlja"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:11
msgid "Click the Header Builder icon in the top bar of the admin panel."
msgstr "Kliknite ikonu Header Builder na gornjoj traci administratorske ploče."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:17
msgid "Manage your headers"
msgstr "Upravljajte svojim zaglavljima"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:18
msgid ""
"This is the Header Builder panel, where you can add, delete, or import "
"headers. Click \"Next\" to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ploča Header Builder, gdje možete dodavati, brisati ili uvoziti "
"zaglavlja. Pritisnite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:24
msgid "Edit the active header"
msgstr "Uredite aktivno zaglavlje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:25
msgid "To access the settings of the active header, click the \"Edit\" button."
msgstr "Za pristup postavkama aktivnog zaglavlja kliknite gumb \"Uredi\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:32
msgid "Header layout settings"
msgstr "Postavke izgleda zaglavlja"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:33
msgid ""
"This panel contains the settings for the current header. You can change the "
"color, size, block arrangement, or add new elements. Click \"Next\" to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Ova ploča sadrži postavke za trenutno zaglavlje. Možete promijeniti boju, "
"veličinu, raspored blokova ili dodati nove elemente. Pritisnite \"Dalje\" za "
"nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:39
msgid "Switch to Frontend editor"
msgstr "Prebacite se na Frontend editor"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:40
msgid ""
"Click the \"Frontend Editor\" button to enable live visual editing of your "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite gumb \"Frontend Editor\" kako biste omogućili vizualno uređivanje "
"zaglavlja uživo."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:46
msgid "Customize header layout in frontend"
msgstr "Prilagodite izgled zaglavlja u sučelju"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:47
msgid ""
"This allows you to view and edit the header directly in the live preview of "
"your website, providing a more intuitive and accurate editing experience."
msgstr ""
"To vam omogućuje pregled i uređivanje zaglavlja izravno u pretpregledu uživo "
"vaše web stranice, pružajući intuitivnije i preciznije iskustvo uređivanja."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:53
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:97
msgid "Access the logo settings"
msgstr "Pristupite postavkama logotipa"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:54
msgid ""
"This is your website logo element in the desktop header. Hover over it and "
"click the \"Pencil\" icon to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je element logotipa vaše web stranice u zaglavlju radne površine. "
"Zadržite pokazivač iznad njega i kliknite ikonu \"Olovka\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:60
msgid "Configure logo element"
msgstr "Konfigurirajte element logotipa"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:61
msgid ""
"In this popup window, you’ll find all the settings related to the logo used "
"in the desktop version of the header. You can also configure a separate logo "
"for the sticky header. Click \"Next\" to continue."
msgstr ""
"U ovom skočnom prozoru pronaći ćete sve postavke povezane s logotipom koji "
"se koristi u verziji zaglavlja za radnu površinu. Također možete "
"konfigurirati zasebni logotip za ljepljivo zaglavlje. Pritisnite \"Dalje\" "
"za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:67
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:111
msgid "Upload your logo"
msgstr "Prenesite svoj logo"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:68
msgid ""
"Select your desktop logo from the Media Library or upload one from your "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite svoj logotip za radnu površinu iz Media Library ili ga prenesite "
"sa svog uređaja."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:75
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:119
msgid "Save logo changes"
msgstr "Spremite promjene logotipa"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:76
msgid ""
"Done! The desktop logo has been successfully uploaded. Click \"Save\" to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Gotovo! Logotip radne površine uspješno je učitan. Pritisnite \"Spremi\" za "
"nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:83
msgid "Switch to mobile header view"
msgstr "Prebacite se na prikaz mobilnog zaglavlja"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:84
msgid ""
"Click the \"Mobile\" button in the Header Builder to view and edit the "
"mobile version of your header."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite gumb \"Mobilno\" u alatu za izradu zaglavlja kako biste vidjeli i "
"uredili mobilnu verziju svog zaglavlja."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:90
msgid "Overview of the mobile header"
msgstr "Pregled mobilnog zaglavlja"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:91
msgid ""
"The mobile header may have a different layout compared to the desktop "
"version. Ensure that all important elements, such as navigation, icons, and "
"menus, are properly arranged for mobile view. Click \"Next\" to continue."
msgstr ""
"Mobilno zaglavlje može imati drugačiji izgled u usporedbi s verzijom za "
"stolna računala. Osigurajte da su svi važni elementi, kao što su navigacija, "
"ikone i izbornici, pravilno raspoređeni za mobilni prikaz. Pritisnite "
"\"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:98
msgid ""
"This is your website logo element in the mobile header. Hover over it and "
"click the \"Pencil\" icon to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je element logotipa vaše web stranice u mobilnom zaglavlju. Zadržite "
"pokazivač iznad njega i kliknite ikonu \"Olovka\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:104
msgid "Configure mobile logo element"
msgstr "Konfigurirajte mobilni element logotipa"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:105
msgid ""
"In this popup window, you can upload a logo specifically for the mobile "
"header. You can also set a different logo for the sticky mobile header."
msgstr ""
"U ovom skočnom prozoru možete učitati logotip posebno za mobilno zaglavlje. "
"Također možete postaviti drugačiji logotip za ljepljivo mobilno zaglavlje."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:112
msgid ""
"Choose your mobile logo from the Media Library or upload one from your "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite svoj mobilni logotip iz Media Library ili ga prenesite sa svog "
"uređaja."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:120
msgid ""
"Done! The mobile logo has been successfully uploaded. Click \"Save\" to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Gotovo! Mobilni logotip je uspješno učitan. Pritisnite \"Spremi\" za "
"nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:127
msgid "Save changes to header"
msgstr "Spremi promjene u zaglavlju"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:128
msgid ""
"Click \"Save header\" to apply and save all changes made to the current "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite \"Spremi zaglavlje\" da biste primijenili i spremili sve promjene "
"napravljene na trenutnom zaglavlju."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:135
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Završi postavljanje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:136
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You’ve successfully replaced the default logo with your own."
" Click the \"Done\" button to finish."
msgstr ""
"čestitamo! Uspješno ste zamijenili zadani logotip svojim. Pritisnite gumb "
"\"Gotovo\" za završetak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:144
msgid "Customize styles and colors"
msgstr "Prilagodite stilove i boje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:145
msgid "Find out how to change the primary color settings"
msgstr "Saznajte kako promijeniti postavke primarne boje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:149
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:229
msgid "Open Theme settings"
msgstr "Otvorite postavke teme"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:150
msgid "This is where all visual customization begins."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:156
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:236
