#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:157
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:237
msgid "This panel allows you to modify most aspects of your site’s appearance."
msgstr ""
"Ova vam ploča omogućuje izmjenu većine aspekata izgleda vaše web stranice."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:163
msgid "Go to the \"Styles and colors\" section"
msgstr "Idite na odjeljak \"Stilovi i boje\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:164
msgid "All customization options for colors and styles are available here."
msgstr "Sve mogućnosti prilagodbe boja i stilova dostupne su ovdje."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:170
msgid "Explore \"Styles and colors\" section"
msgstr "Istražite odjeljak \"Stilovi i boje\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:171
msgid ""
"In these submenus, you can modify colors, page backgrounds, border radius, "
"button styles, form fields, and carousel navigation."
msgstr ""
"U ovim podizbornicima možete mijenjati boje, pozadine stranica, radijus "
"obruba, stilove gumba, polja obrazaca i navigaciju vrtuljkom."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:177
msgid "Select the \"Colors\" menu item"
msgstr "Odaberite stavku izbornika \"Boje\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:178
msgid "This section contains all the global color controls for your website."
msgstr "Ovaj odjeljak sadrži sve globalne kontrole boja za vašu web stranicu."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:184
msgid "Explore color settings"
msgstr "Istražite postavke boja"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:185
msgid ""
"Here you’ll find options for primary color, secondary color, and links color "
"— these are key elements that define your website’s visual identity."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje ćete pronaći opcije za primarnu boju, sekundarnu boju i boju poveznica "
"— to su ključni elementi koji definiraju vizualni identitet vaše web "
"stranice."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:191
msgid "Change primary color"
msgstr "Promjena primarne boje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:192
msgid ""
"The primary color is used for buttons, active elements, and highlights "
"across your site. Try clicking the color picker to change this color."
msgstr ""
"Primarna boja koristi se za gumbe, aktivne elemente i istaknute dijelove na "
"vašoj web-lokaciji. Pokušajte kliknuti birač boja kako biste promijenili ovu "
"boju."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:199
msgid "Change secondary color"
msgstr "Promjena sekundarne boje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:200
msgid ""
"The secondary color is used for secondary accents and complementary elements "
"that may contrast with the primary color. Try clicking the color picker to "
"change this color."
msgstr ""
"Sekundarna boja koristi se za sekundarne naglaske i komplementarne elemente "
"koji mogu biti u kontrastu s primarnom bojom. Pokušajte kliknuti birač boja "
"kako biste promijenili ovu boju."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:207
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:285
msgid "Save your changes"
msgstr "Spremite promjene"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:208
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:286
