msgid "Explore \"Typography\" section"
msgstr "Istražite odjeljak \"Tipografija\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:251
msgid "These section are organized by purpose:"
msgstr "Ovi su odjeljci organizirani prema namjeni:"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:252
msgid "<b>Basic</b> for general text settings"
msgstr "<b>Basic</b> za opće postavke teksta"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:253
msgid "<b>Advanced</b> for fine-tuning"
msgstr "<b>Napredno</b> za fino podešavanje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:254
msgid "<b>Custom fonts</b> for uploading your own typefaces"
msgstr "<b>Prilagođeni fontovi</b> za učitavanje vlastitih pisama"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:255
msgid "<b>Icon fonts</b> for managing symbol fonts"
msgstr "<b>Fontovi ikona</b> za upravljanje fontovima simbola"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:256
msgid "<b>Adobe fonts</b> for integrating with Adobe’s service"
msgstr "<b>Adobe fontovi</b> za integraciju s Adobeovom uslugom"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:262
msgid "Typography settings overview"
msgstr "Pregled postavki tipografije"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:263
msgid ""
"This section lets you control the appearance of text across your entire site "
"— including body text and headings."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj vam odjeljak omogućuje kontrolu izgleda teksta na cijelom web-mjestu — "
"uključujući tekst i naslove."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:269
msgid "Adjust text font options"
msgstr "Podesite opcije fonta teksta"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:270
msgid ""
"This options defines the default typography for your site’s body text, "
"including paragraphs and general content. You’ll find several key controls "
"here: font family, font weight, font subset, font size and color. Review and "
"change these settings as needed. When you’re done, click \"Next\" to "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija definira zadanu tipografiju za glavni tekst vaše web stranice, "
"uključujući odlomke i opći sadržaj. Ovdje ćete pronaći nekoliko ključnih "
"kontrola: obitelj fontova, težinu fonta, podskup fontova, veličinu i boju "
"fonta. Pregledajte i po potrebi promijenite ove postavke. Kada završite, "
"kliknite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:277
msgid "Adjust title font options"
msgstr "Podesite opcije fonta naslova"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:278
msgid ""
"This options controls the typography for all heading elements on your site, "
"such as h1–h6 tags. You can modify several controls: font family, font "
"weight, font subset, font size, and color. Choose values that fit your "
"site’s visual hierarchy. Then, click \"Next\" to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija kontrolira tipografiju za sve elemente naslova na vašem web-"
"mjestu, kao što su oznake h1–h6. Možete promijeniti nekoliko kontrola: "
"obitelj fontova, težinu fonta, podskup fonta, veličinu fonta i boju. "
"Odaberite vrijednosti koje odgovaraju vizualnoj hijerarhiji vaše web-"
"lokacije. Zatim kliknite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:294
msgid ""
"You’ve successfully customized your site’s typography for text and headings. "
"Click the \"Done\" button to finish."
msgstr ""
"Uspješno ste prilagodili tipografiju svoje stranice za tekst i naslove. "
"Pritisnite gumb \"Gotovo\" za završetak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:302
msgid "Edit the main navigation menu"
msgstr "Uredite glavni navigacijski izbornik"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:303
msgid "Learn how to edit or add items to the main menu"
msgstr "Naučite kako urediti ili dodati stavke u glavni izbornik"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:307
msgid "Hover over \"Appearance\""
msgstr "Zadržite pokazivač iznad \"Izgled\""

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:308
msgid ""
"In the WordPress dashboard, hover over the \"Appearance\" section in the "
"sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Na nadzornoj ploči WordPressa zadržite pokazivač iznad odjeljka \"Izgled\" "
"na bočnoj traci."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:315
msgid "Open menus settings"
msgstr "Otvorite postavke izbornika"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:316
msgid "Click on \"Menus\" in the dropdown that appears."
msgstr "Kliknite na \"Izbornici\" u padajućem izborniku koji se pojavi."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:322
msgid "What is the \"Menus\" section?"
msgstr "Što je odjeljak \"Meniji\"?"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:323
msgid ""
"This is where you create new menus, edit existing ones, and assign them to "
"different locations on your site."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje stvarate nove izbornike, uređujete postojeće i dodjeljujete ih "
"različitim mjestima na svojoj web stranici."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:329
msgid "Go to the \"Manage Locations\" tab"
msgstr "Idite na karticu \"Upravljanje lokacijama\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:330
msgid "Click on the \"Manage Locations\" tab at the top of the Menus screen."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite karticu \"Upravljanje lokacijama\" na vrhu zaslona s izbornicima."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:336
msgid "Explore menu locations"
msgstr "Istražite lokacije jelovnika"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:337
msgid "In this table, you’ll see two default menu positions in WordPress:"
msgstr "U ovoj tablici vidjet ćete dva zadana položaja izbornika u WordPressu:"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:338
msgid "<b>Main Menu</b> – the primary navigation shown on desktop."
msgstr ""
"<b>Glavni izbornik</b> – primarna navigacija prikazana na radnoj površini."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:339
msgid "<b>Mobile Side Menu</b> – the navigation used for mobile view."
msgstr ""
"<b>Mobilni bočni izbornik</b> – navigacija koja se koristi za mobilni prikaz."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:345
msgid "Edit or create a menu"
msgstr "Uredite ili izradite jelovnik"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:346
msgid ""
"Click \"Edit\" to modify an existing menu, or click \"Use new menu\" to "
"create one from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite \"Uredi\" da biste izmijenili postojeći izbornik ili kliknite "
"\"Upotrijebi novi izbornik\" da biste ga stvorili ispočetka."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:352
msgid "Enter menu name"
msgstr "Unesite naziv izbornika"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:353
msgid ""
"Type a name for your new menu in the \"Menu name\" field. This name is for "
"internal use only and helps you identify the menu later."
msgstr ""
"Unesite naziv za svoj novi izbornik u polje \"Naziv izbornika\". Ovo je ime "
"samo za internu upotrebu i pomaže vam da kasnije identificirate izbornik."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:361
msgid "Save the menu"
msgstr "Spremite jelovnik"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:362
msgid ""
"Click the \"Create menu\" button to save your new menu. You’ll now be able "
"to add menu items and assign it to a location."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite gumb \"Stvori izbornik\" da biste spremili svoj novi izbornik. "
"Sada ćete moći dodati stavke jelovnika i dodijeliti ih lokaciji."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:370
msgid "Select item to add"
msgstr "Odaberite stavku za dodavanje"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:371
msgid "Choose the page you want to add to your menu."
msgstr "Odaberite stranicu koju želite dodati u svoj jelovnik."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:377
msgid "Add item to the menu"
msgstr "Dodaj stavku u jelovnik"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:378
msgid ""
"After selecting the item, click the \"Add to Menu\" button to include them "
"in your menu structure on the right."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što odaberete stavku, kliknite gumb \"Dodaj u izbornik\" kako biste ih "
"uključili u strukturu izbornika s desne strane."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:385
msgid "Expand the menu item"
msgstr "Proširite stavku izbornika"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:386
msgid "Click the arrow on the newly added menu item to expand its settings."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite strelicu na novo dodanoj stavci izbornika da biste proširili "
"njezine postavke."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:392
msgid "Explore menu item settings"
msgstr "Istražite postavke stavki izbornika"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:393
msgid "Each menu item includes several customization options: "
msgstr "Svaka stavka izbornika uključuje nekoliko opcija prilagodbe:"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:394
msgid "<b>Navigation label</b> – the text shown in the menu."
msgstr "<b>Navigacijska oznaka</b> – tekst prikazan u izborniku."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:395
msgid "<b>Title attribute</b> – optional tooltip shown on hover."
msgstr ""
"<b>Atribut naslova</b> – izborni opis alata koji se prikazuje kada lebdite."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:396
msgid "<b>Dropdown settings</b> – submenu design and appearance selection."
msgstr "<b>Padajuće postavke</b> – dizajn podizbornika i odabir izgleda."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:397
msgid ""
"<b>Label settings</b> – adding a color label next to the menu item title."
msgstr ""
"<b>Postavke oznake</b> – dodavanje oznake u boji pored naslova stavke "
"izbornika."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:398
msgid "<b>Image settings</b> – set an icon or background for the menu item."
msgstr ""
"<b>Postavke slike</b> – postavite ikonu ili pozadinu za stavku izbornika."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:399
msgid "<b>Extra options</b> – additional menu item settings."
msgstr "<b>Dodatne opcije</b> – dodatne postavke stavki izbornika."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:400
msgid ""
"Review these options and make any necessary changes. Once you're done, click "
"\"Next\" to continue."
msgstr ""
"Pregledajte ove opcije i napravite sve potrebne promjene. Kada završite, "
"kliknite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:407
msgid "Save your menu"
msgstr "Spremite svoj jelovnik"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:408
msgid ""
"Click the \"Save menu\" button to apply all your changes and make the menu "
"active on your site."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite gumb \"Spremi izbornik\" kako biste primijenili sve svoje "
"promjene i aktivirali izbornik na svojoj web stranici."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:417
msgid ""
"Your WordPress menu is now ready. You’ve successfully updated your menu, "
"added items, configured settings, and saved it. Your changes are now live on "
"your site. Click the \"Done\" button to finish."
msgstr ""
"Vaš WordPress izbornik sada je spreman. Uspješno ste ažurirali svoj jelovnik,"
" dodali stavke, konfigurirali postavke i spremili ga. Vaše promjene sada su "
"aktivne na vašoj web-lokaciji. Pritisnite gumb \"Gotovo\" za završetak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:425
msgid "Modifying the site content via Elementor"
msgstr "Izmjena sadržaja stranice putem Elementora"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:426
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:509
msgid "Find out how to update the homepage title step by step"
msgstr "Saznajte kako korak po korak ažurirati naslov početne stranice"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:431
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:514
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:597
msgid "Go to the Homepage"
msgstr "Idite na početnu stranicu"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:432
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:515
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:598
msgid ""
"Click the site name in the top admin bar to navigate to the homepage of your "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite naziv web-mjesta na gornjoj administratorskoj traci za navigaciju "
"na početnu stranicu vašeg web-mjesta."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:438
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:521
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:604
msgid "Homepage overview"
msgstr "Pregled početne stranice"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:439
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:522
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:605
msgid ""
"This is the homepage of your website. It displays the content that visitors "
"see first, including banners, titles, and key sections."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je početna stranica vaše web stranice. Prikazuje sadržaj koji "
"posjetitelji prvi vide, uključujući bannere, naslove i ključne dijelove."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:445
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:528
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:611
msgid "Edit the page"
msgstr "Uredite stranicu"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:446
msgid ""
"Click the \"Edit page\" button in the top admin bar to open the homepage in "
"the Elementor editor."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb \"Uredi stranicu\" na gornjoj administratorskoj traci da "
"otvorite početnu stranicu u uređivaču Elementor."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:452
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:535
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:618
msgid "Page editor overview"
msgstr "Pregled uređivača stranice"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:453
msgid ""
"You are now in the WordPress page editor. When using Elementor, this page "
"serves as a transitional screen between WordPress and the Elementor editor. "
"Click \"Next\" to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Sada ste u uređivaču stranice WordPress. Kada koristite Elementor, ova "
"stranica služi kao prijelazni zaslon između WordPressa i Elementor uređivača."
" Pritisnite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:459
msgid "Edit with Elementor"
msgstr "Uredite pomoću Elementora"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:460
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Edit with Elementor\" button to launch the Elementor page "
"builder and start editing the content of your page with its powerful tools."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na gumb \"Uredi s Elementorom\" kako biste pokrenuli alat za izradu "
"stranica Elementor i počeli uređivati ​​sadržaj svoje stranice pomoću moćnih "
"alata."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:468
msgid "Elementor editor overview"
msgstr "Pregled uređivača Elementor"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:469
msgid ""
"Here, you'll see two areas: the sidebar panel with available elements and "
"the main area for editing your page content."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje ćete vidjeti dva područja: ploču bočne trake s dostupnim elementima i "
"glavno područje za uređivanje sadržaja stranice."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:475
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:640
msgid "Select the \"Section title\" element"
msgstr "Odaberite element \"Naslov odjeljka\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:476
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Section title\" element to select the heading section you "
"want to edit."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na element \"Naslov odjeljka\" da odaberete odjeljak naslova koji "
"želite urediti."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:482
msgid "Customize content and style"
msgstr "Prilagodite sadržaj i stil"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:483
msgid ""
"Here, you can edit the content fields, adjust element-specific settings, and "
"apply style changes such as colors, spacing, and typography. Once you're "
"done customizing the content and design of the element, click \"Next\"."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete urediti polja sadržaja, prilagoditi postavke specifične za "
"elemente i primijeniti promjene stila kao što su boje, razmaci i tipografija."
" Nakon što završite s prilagodbom sadržaja i dizajna elementa, kliknite "
"\"Dalje\"."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:490
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:574
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:663
msgid "Save the page"
msgstr "Spremite stranicu"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:491
msgid ""
"After making all the necessary changes to the title element, click the "
"\"Publish\" button to save your changes."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što izvršite sve potrebne izmjene naslovnog elementa, kliknite gumb "
"\"Objavi\" da biste spremili promjene."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:499
#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:583
msgid ""
"Your homepage title has been successfully updated – the changes are now live."
" Click the \"Done\" button to finish."
msgstr ""
"Naslov vaše početne stranice uspješno je ažuriran – promjene su sada aktivne."
" Pritisnite gumb \"Gotovo\" za završetak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:508
msgid "Modifying the site content via Gutenberg"
msgstr "Izmjena sadržaja stranice putem Gutenberga"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:529
msgid ""
"Click the \"Edit page\" button in the top admin bar to open the homepage in "
"the block editor."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb \"Uredi stranicu\" na gornjoj administratorskoj traci da "
"otvorite početnu stranicu u uređivaču blokova."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:536
msgid ""
"You are now in the WordPress block editor. Here, you can manage the layout "
"and content of your page using blocks such as headings, paragraphs, images, "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Sada ste u WordPress uređivaču blokova. Ovdje možete upravljati izgledom i "
"sadržajem svoje stranice pomoću blokova kao što su naslovi, odlomci, slike i "
"drugo."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:542
msgid "Select the title block"
msgstr "Odaberite blok naslova"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:543
msgid ""
"Click on the title block on the page. This is typically a heading block that "
"displays the main title of the section or page."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na blok naslova na stranici. Ovo je obično blok naslova koji "
"prikazuje glavni naslov odjeljka ili stranice."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:550
msgid "Change the title text"
msgstr "Promijenite tekst naslova"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:551
msgid ""
"Update the text in the title block as needed. Once you've made your changes, "
"click \"Next\" to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi ažurirajte tekst u bloku naslova. Nakon što izvršite izmjene, "
"kliknite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:558
msgid "Open the sidebar settings"
msgstr "Otvorite postavke bočne trake"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:559
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Settings\" icon in the top right corner of the editor to open "
"the sidebar panel. This panel contains various settings for the selected "
"block."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ikonu \"Postavke\" u gornjem desnom kutu uređivača da biste "
"otvorili ploču bočne trake. Ova ploča sadrži različite postavke za odabrani "
"blok."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:566
msgid "Adjust the title element settings"
msgstr "Podesite postavke naslovnog elementa"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:567
msgid ""
"The sidebar will display the settings for the title element, including "
"options for style, color, design, appearance, positioning, and more. Adjust "
"these settings as needed, and once you're satisfied, click \"Next\" to "
"proceed."
msgstr ""
"Bočna traka će prikazati postavke za naslovni element, uključujući opcije za "
"stil, boju, dizajn, izgled, pozicioniranje i još mnogo toga. Prilagodite ove "
"postavke prema potrebi i kada budete zadovoljni kliknite \"Dalje\" za "
"nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:575
msgid ""
"After making all the necessary changes to the title element, click the "
"\"Save\" button to save your changes."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što izvršite sve potrebne izmjene naslovnog elementa, kliknite gumb "
"\"Spremi\" da biste spremili promjene."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:591
msgid "Modifying the site content via WPBakery"
msgstr "Izmjena sadržaja stranice putem WPBakery"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:592
msgid "Find out how to update the homepage title step by step."
msgstr "Saznajte kako korak po korak ažurirati naslov početne stranice."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:612
msgid ""
"Click the \"Edit page\" button in the top admin bar to open the homepage in "
"the WPBakery editor."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb \"Uredi stranicu\" na gornjoj administratorskoj traci da "
"otvorite početnu stranicu u uređivaču WPBakery."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:619
msgid ""
"You are now in the WordPress page editor. When using WPBakery, this page "
"serves as a transitional screen between WordPress and the WPBakery editor. "
"Click \"Next\" to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Sada ste u uređivaču stranice WordPress. Kada koristite WPBakery, ova "
"stranica služi kao prijelazni zaslon između WordPressa i WPBakery uređivača. "
"Pritisnite \"Dalje\" za nastavak."

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:625
msgid "Switch to WPBakery"
msgstr "Prijeđite na WPBakery"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:626
msgid ""
"Click on the \"WPBakery Page Builder\" button to launch the WPBakery page "
