msgstr "Možete ručno ukloniti neke stilove na svim stranicama."

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:135
msgid "Disable Swiper slider script on mobile devices"
msgstr "Onemogućite skriptu klizača Swiper na mobilnim uređajima"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:137
msgid ""
"Using native browser scrolling feature on mobile devices may improve your "
"page loading and performance on some devices. This option does not apply to "
"the main product carousel and WoodMart slider."
msgstr ""
"Korištenje izvorne značajke pomicanja preglednika na mobilnim uređajima može "
"poboljšati učitavanje stranice i performanse na nekim uređajima. Ova se "
"opcija ne odnosi na vrtuljak glavnog proizvoda i WoodMart klizač."

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:152
msgid "Remove jQuery Migrate"
msgstr "Uklonite jQuery Migrate"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:153
msgid "Remove jQuery Migrate eliminates a JS file and can improve load time."
msgstr ""
"Ukloni jQuery Migrate uklanja JS datoteku i može poboljšati vrijeme "
"učitavanja."

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:173
msgid ""
"Our theme is designed to load only the scripts and libraries required for "
"each specific page. However, if you need to load a particular script "
"globally for any reason, you can use the following options."
msgstr ""
"Naša je tema dizajnirana za učitavanje samo skripti i biblioteka potrebnih "
"za svaku pojedinu stranicu. Međutim, ako morate globalno učitati određenu "
"skriptu iz bilo kojeg razloga, možete koristiti sljedeće opcije."

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:192
msgid "Advanced scripts controls"
msgstr "Napredne kontrole skripti"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:194
msgid ""
"This option doesn't affect anything. It just shows/hides all scripts "
"configuration. Note that we don't recommend you enable/disable any scripts "
"if you are not sure how they work."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija ne utječe ni na što. Samo prikazuje/skriva sve konfiguracije "
"skripti. Imajte na umu da ne preporučujemo da omogućite/onemogućite bilo "
"koju skriptu ako niste sigurni kako funkcionira."

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:209
msgid "library"
msgstr "knjižnica"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:214
msgid "Always load"
msgstr "Uvijek opterećenje"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:218
msgid "On demand"
msgstr "Na zahtjev"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:222
msgid "Never load"
msgstr "Nikad ne učitavajte"

